@host = http://localhost:9804/tool

### 1. tool-calling
GET {{host}}/tool-calling
Accept: application/json

### 2. per-tool-calling
GET {{host}}/per-tool-calling
Accept: application/json

### 3. quick-start
GET {{host}}/quick-start
Accept: application/json

### 3. /weather/ask
GET {{host}}/weather/ask?question=北京今天天气怎么样
Accept: application/json


### 4. 首先在session.http中获取会话id,然后运行这个
GET {{host}}/e161c992-89af-4a20-9b69-5a11be46ef9a/weather/ask?question=北京今天天气怎么样
X-User: alice

### 4-1. 继续问
GET {{host}}/e161c992-89af-4a20-9b69-5a11be46ef9a/weather/ask?question=上海今天天气怎么样
X-User: alice

### 4-2. 继续问
GET {{host}}/e161c992-89af-4a20-9b69-5a11be46ef9a/weather/ask?question=西安今天天气怎么样
X-User: alice

### 5. search
GET {{host}}/search
Accept: application/json

### 6. tool-call-confirmation
POST {{host}}/tool-call-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "先查一下 张三 的邮箱，然后给他发一封感谢邮件"
}
